==Strategy==
This stage is quite challenging; consistent Brollow spam backed up by two Hackeys can cause some serious trouble.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] - Jellycat can heavily damage a set of Brollows, which is great for relieving pressure from your attackers as they try to get hits onto Hackey. Also useful for killing the Crocos at the beginning. Make sure that the Brollows are already weakened by [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] so that Jellycat can kill them.
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] - One of the only viable meatshields for this stage, Boulder Cat can hold the frontline better than any other meatshield, but isnt that spammable along with dying after their attack. Make sure to pair them with another meatshield and research Combos to get the most value.
*[[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Mohawk Cat]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]] - Cheap and spammable meatshields that will take one hit from a Brollow (more if they are synced) and will die straight after. A pretty good way to prevent Brollow from killing an attacker.
*[[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]] - While normally unavailable on the first try, he can trivialize higher difficulties when paired with Boulder Cat and research combos. With the Brollow spam, money isn't a problem, so there's pratically no downside to using him.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] - has way too much damage for his own good, but is very useful for exploiting a Brollow for money and damaging the Hackeys.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Moves fast, attacks fast, and can spit damage at the Hackeys pretty well. He can be a double edged sword though, as he doesn't do enough damage to completely kill Brollow and allows him to get another hit on your units. But this can also be used to sync them, so that only a single meatshield is needed to stall them.
*[[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] - Only usable with [[Explosion]] talent. Can help alleviate the pressure on your frontline and make short work of the Hackeys.

